* Process : UMC 0.11 um Logic and Mixed-Mode 1P8M Metal Metal Capacitor Al Advanced Enhancement Process
* Device Type:  MIM Capacitor
* Description:  MIM model 
* Simulator:    HSPICE 
* Model Version:V101
* Device  : 1.0 fF/um^2 MIMCAP
*           1.5 fF/um^2 MIMCAP           
*           2.0 fF/um^2 MIMCAP 
* Note:  This model is a simplified two-terminal capacitor model for Mixed-Mode application, in which the
*        parasitic effects such as serias resistance, inductance and substrate coupling capacitances are 
*        not included. 
*
********************************************************************************
* Revision history:
* <Revision 1>
* Version : 0.1 p1
* Date    : 2010 / 01 / 08
* Author  : Jian Zhi Huang
* Remark  : 1. Copy model from l110eal_mimcap_vt21.lib in the G-05-LOGIC/MIXED_MODE11-MMC/AL/L110E-SPICE
*           2. DSM version definition from 2009/11/30.
* <Revision 2>
* Version : 0.2 p1
* Date    : 2010 / 06 / 23
* Author  : Kelly Pao
* Remark  : 1. Based on new silicon data.
*           2. DSM version definition from 2009/11/30.
* <Revision 3>
* Version : 0.3 p1
* Date    : 2010 / 12 / 08
* Author  : Hung Wei Liao
* Remark  : 1. Add 20f MIMCAP Model 
*  <Revision 4>   
*  Version : 0.4 p1   
*  Date  : 2012/09/27 
*  Author  : Ji Wei Hsu   
*  Remark  : 1. Modify 20f MIMCAP Model
*  <Revision 5>   
*  Version : 0.5 p1   
*  Date  : 2013/08/9 
*  Author  : Ting Huei Wang   
*  Remark  : 1. Change 20f MIMCAP Model minimum size from 4.8*4.8(um^2) to 3.4*3.4(um^2)
* <Revision 5>   
* Version : 0.6 p1   
* Date  : 2015/04/15 
* Author  : Zung Jie Han   
* Remark  : 1. Change 20f MIMCAP Model "cf" parameter from 4.96e-11 to 4.95e-11
* <Revision 6>   
* Version : 1.0 p1   
* Date  : 2016/05/23 
* Author  : Tzu Kang Hsiung  
* Remark  : 1. Modify  15f and 10f MIMCAP Model based on new silicon data .
*           2. Add trend chart of mapping data into the  document .
*           3. Revise  the  verification  figure (with VC & with  TC)  of  2.0fF MIMCAP .
********************************************************************************
.subckt mimcaps_20f_mml110e n1 n2 l=49.2e-6 w=49.2e-6
.param dt='temper-25'      
.param ca='2e-3'
.param cf='4.95e-11'
c1 n1 n2 '((l*0.9*w*0.9*ca)*(1+d_ca_mimcaps_20f_mml110e)+2*cf*(l*0.9+w*0.9))*(1+1.8e-5*dt-1.45e-9*dt*dt)*(1-8.97e-6*v(n1,n2)+1.42e-5*v(n1,n2)*v(n1,n2))'

.ends mimcaps_20f_mml110e

.subckt mimcaps_15f_mml110e n1 n2 l=49.2e-6 w=49.2e-6
.param dt='temper-25'      
.param ca='1.5e-3'
.param cf='3.98e-11'
c1 n1 n2 '((l*0.9*w*0.9*ca)*(1+d_ca_mimcaps_15f_mml110e)+2*cf*(l*0.9+w*0.9))*(1+1.58e-5*dt+2.90e-9*dt*dt)*(1-6.84e-6*v(n1,n2)+5.67e-6*v(n1,n2)*v(n1,n2))'

.ends mimcaps_15f_mml110e

.subckt mimcaps_10f_mml110e n1 n2 l=49.2e-6 w=49.2e-6
.param dt='temper-25'      
.param ca='1.0e-3'
.param cf='4.63e-11'
c1 n1 n2 '((l*0.9*w*0.9*ca)*(1+d_ca_mimcaps_10f_mml110e)+2*cf*(l*0.9+w*0.9))*(1+1.12e-5*dt+9.0e-9*dt*dt)*(1-2.81e-5*v(n1,n2)-2.17e-6*v(n1,n2)*v(n1,n2))'

.ends mimcaps_10f_mml110e
